{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SwipeGo 是一款以滑動方式清理相簿的相片管理工具，適合手機儲存空間經常吃緊、又不想逐張整理相片的使用者。它會自動把相片分成小組，每組最多 16 張，讓你左右滑動就能快速篩選。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>智能分組滑動清理相簿</h2>\n<p>SwipeGo 會把相片整理成智能分組，每組最多 16 張，讓清理變得輕鬆。操作方式簡單直接：向左滑動略過，向右滑動加入收藏，亦可選擇刪除。你還能按年份、月份或媒體類型瀏覽相片，並查看已檢視項目、已刪除項目及節省下來的儲存空間。整個過程只在本機進行，私隱更有保障。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-396-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-397-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-398-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-399-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-400-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-401-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SwipeGo-AI Cleaner Master</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:17:07.446288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}